"r":103,"l":107,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["أَجْرٌۭ","N","stem","M|INDEF|NOM"]]},{"i":"67:12:9","a":"كَبِيرٌۭ","t":"great","p":"ADJ","tr":"kabīrun","f":["MS","INDEF","NOM"],"r":66,"l":290},{"e":"١٢","v":"67:12"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"67:1","t":"Blessed is He in whose hand is dominion, and He is over all things competent -","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"67:2","t":"[He] who created death and life to test you [as to] which of you is best in deed - and He is the Exalted in Might, the Forgiving -","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"67:3","t":"[And] who created seven heavens in layers. You do not see in the creation of the Most Merciful any inconsistency. So return [your] vision [to the sky]; do you see any breaks?","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"67:4","t":"Then return [your] vision twice again. [Your] vision will return to you humbled while it is fatigued.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"67:5","t":"And We have certainly beautified the nearest heaven with lamps [i.e., stars] and have made [from] them what is thrown at the devils and have prepared for them the punishment of the Blaze.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"67:6","t":"And for those who disbelieved in their Lord is the punishment of Hell, and wretched is the destination.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"67:7","t":"When they are thrown into it, they hear from it a [dreadful] inhaling while it boils up.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"67:8","t":"It almost bursts with rage. Every time a company is thrown into it, its keepers ask them, \"Did there not come to you a warner?\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"67:9","t":"They will say, \"Yes, a warner had come to us, but we denied and said, 'Allāh has not sent down anything. You are not but in great error.'\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"67:10","t":"And they will say, \"If only we had been listening or reasoning, we would not be among the companions of the Blaze.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"67:11","t":"And they will admit their sin, so [it is] alienation for the companions of the Blaze.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"67:12","t":"Indeed, those who fear their Lord unseen will have forgiveness and great reward.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":12,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":57,"surahs":[67],"sajdah":false}